WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.500
Where the lines cross, the two plans cost the same.

2
00:00:04.278 --> 00:00:09.578
Plan A is twenty dollars plus five per gigabyte; Plan B is one flat price.

3
00:00:10.382 --> 00:00:14.957
Here Plan B is thirty dollars, the same as Plan A at two gigabytes.

4
00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:20.557
Make Plan B forty dollars, and now they cost the same at four gigabytes.

5
00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:27.167
Left of the crossing, Plan A is cheaper; to the right, Plan B is.
